        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "The Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) provides geographical information on land cover and land use and their changes, ground motion, vegetation state, water cycle and Earth's surface energy variables for both Europe and the entire globe.<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "CLMS is jointly implemented by the European Environment Agency and the European Commission DG Joint Research Centre (JRC) and has been operational since 2012.<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "CLMS consists of several components.<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "Visit the website [land.copernicus.eu](https://land.copernicus.eu/en){target='_blank'} for further information.<br><br>\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-important}\n",
        "## Disclaimer: CLMS Product Availability on CDSE\n",
        "CLMS is in the process of onboarding its products to the CDSE. The migration process is expected to last until the end of 2026. Until the process is finalized, not all CLMS products will be available on the CDSE. Onboarded products will be listed in the tables below.\n",
        "\n",
        "For the complete CLMS data catalog, please consult [land.copernicus.eu](https://land.copernicus.eu/en){target='_blank'}.\n",
        "\n",
        "We appreciate your understanding and patience as we work to integrate our full suite of products. For the most up-to-date information on product availability, please check back regularly or contact our support team.\n",
        "\n",
        "Thank you for your continued support.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-note icon=false} \n",
        "## Data access on CDSE\n",
        "\n",
        "CLMS products are accessible via [S3 Access](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/S3.html){target='_blank'}, [OData](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/OData.html){target='_blank'}, the [Sentinel Hub APIs](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/CLMS.html){target='_blank'}, and the [Copernicus Browser](https://browser.dataspace.copernicus.eu/?zoom=5&lat=50.16282&lng=20.78613&themeId=DEFAULT-THEME&visualizationUrl=U2FsdGVkX18Tt8UKqBo9yzVmJJsMSRWlX0iuI7BzLkeodz5zJDbqQ%2ButoOcHP%2FlTue%2BCxjJhwVZ%2FwmDOPegyADQEeinqHSB8vRDu0oPKEJ5LnvXyVTYEnslTGURLghn7&datasetId=COPERNICUS_CLMS_VEGETATION_INDICES_NDVI_GLOBAL&demSource3D=%22MAPZEN%22&cloudCoverage=30&dateMode=SINGLE){target='_blank'}.\n",
        "\n",
        "For downloadable lists in CSV format, refer to the [CSV Copernicus Catalogue](https://csv.dataspace.copernicus.eu/CLMS/){target='_blank'}.\n",
        "\n",
        "To help you construct OData queries tailored to your needs, we provide example queries along with detailed information on CLMS-specific metadata parameters. See [Catalogue and search attributes](#catalogue-and-search-attributes) and [CLMS OData metadata specification](#clms-odata-metadata-specification).\n",
        "\n",
        "We provide **product-specific S3 paths and data-access links** in the overview tables below.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
