        "<br><br>\n",
        "\n",
        "# Catalogue and search attributes {#catalogue-and-search-attributes}\n",
        "\n",
        "All data sets in the CLMS collection can be accessed using CLMS-specific metadata parameters.<br>\n",
        "This section explains the specific attributes and the relevant allowable values that can be utilized in data searches via the OData API and the Copernicus Browser.\n",
        "\n",
        "For further guidance on how to use OData and the Browser, kindly refer to the [OData](../../APIs/OData.html) and [About the Browser](../../Applications/Browser.html) pages.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Examples of OData queries\n",
        "\n",
        "Below are some (not exhaustive) examples of OData queries that you can use and modify according to your needs.<br>\n",
        "List of acceptable expand attribute names for CLMS:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# HTTPS Request\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CLMS)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CLMS)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "A description of all metadata including the additional attributes can be found in [CLMS OData metadata specification](#clms-odata-metadata-specification).\n",
        "\n",
        "To search the entire CLMS collection:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# HTTPS Request\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Products?$filter=Collection/Name%20eq%20%27CLMS%27`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Products?$filter=Collection/Name%20eq%20%27CLMS%27){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-tip} \n",
        "\n",
        "Please be aware that the results are paginated and limited to 20 products per page. The @odata.nextLink at the bottom of the response provides the link for the next 20 products.<br>    \n",
